ist), and catches an unknown option, the unmigrated one-record `resolveOne { schema; layers; }` and `instanceOf cnf { aspect; value; … }`, and `classes`, a `cnf` key the library no longer reads, as a plain unknown key; `options-first-composes-link-delivery` holds it at gen-link (`link { wire; }` applied to C11's sources in both orders, `originStamp { } [ \"bolt\" ]` mapped over two registries, `entry { via; }` over two edges) and gen-delivery (`project { selectNodes; } cnf` mapped over two value sets), reads the contracts as data (`entry`'s record step under `next`), and catches an unknown option, the unmigrated one-record `link { sources; }`, `project { values; cnf; }` and `realize { projected; terminals; }`, and `via` given on `entry`'s record";
